{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOB","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"約伯記","commonName":"約伯記","title":"約伯記","order":18,"numberOfChapters":42,"sha256":"3aa72174529879f59c9c24a590c7f512dafc69fc78e843aed0f93864112147ea","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":42,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/42.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1068},"chapter":{"number":32,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以利戶的回答"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["三人見約伯自以為義，便不再回答他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那時，蘭族的布西人巴拉迦的兒子以利戶對約伯很惱火，因為約伯自以為義，不承認上帝的公義。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他對約伯的三個朋友也很惱火，因為他們說約伯有罪，卻無法回答約伯的質問",{"noteId":15},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["由於不及他們年長，以利戶便等他們說完才向約伯發言。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他見三人無法回答約伯，很惱火。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["於是，布西人巴拉迦的兒子以利戶說：",{"text":"「我年紀輕，你們是長輩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我畏懼，不敢向你們陳明觀點。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我想，前輩當先發言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"長者當傳授智慧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但只有人裡面的靈——","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全能者的氣息賜人悟性。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"長者不一定有智慧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"年老不一定明白是非。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，請聽我說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要陳明觀點。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我一直等候你們發言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"傾聽你們的高見，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等你們斟詞酌句。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我仔細聆聽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"發現你們無人能駁倒約伯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人能答覆他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們不要說，『我們找到了智慧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他折服的是上帝而非人。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"約伯沒有與我辯論，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不會用你們的理論答覆他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"「他們驚慌失措，無言以對，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也說不出話來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道他們不說話，站在那裡無言以對，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就要等下去嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要作出答覆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"陳明我的觀點。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我心裡積滿了話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我裡面的靈催促我說出來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我裡面像盛滿了酒，卻沒有出口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如將要破裂的新酒袋。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要一吐為快，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要開口答覆。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不看人的情面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不奉承人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不懂奉承，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"否則，造物主會很快把我除掉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":15,"caller":"+","text":"「因為他們說約伯有罪，卻無法回答約伯的質問」有古卷作「因為他們無法回答約伯的質問，因而置上帝於不公」。","reference":{"chapter":32,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/32.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/33.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOB/31.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}